<title>GERMANY: Unclear if G7 will issue communique - Waigel.</title>
<headline>Unclear if G7 will issue communique - Waigel.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Finance Minister Theo Waigel said it was not yet clear whether the Group of Seven would issue a communique or statement after today's meeting in Berlin.</p>
<p>&quot;It is not yet clear. It depends on the discussions,&quot; he said in answer to a question at a briefing.</p>
<p>But he added, &quot;We are prepared for all eventualities.&quot;</p>
<p>--Berlin Newsroom +49 30 203 9810</p>
</text>
